      "title": "Render logging — the publish branch keeps its own history",
      "description": "Log every render to the publish branch — what was published, removed, restored or deliberately retained — to an append-only log that lives beside what it describes. Use when adding or removing anything on `gh-pages`, when asking \"what happened to this preview\", or before writing a workflow step that deletes a published artefact.",
